From sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov  Mon Aug  2 11:59:56 2004
From: sdavis2 at mail.nih.gov (Sean Davis)
Date: Mon Aug  2 11:58:33 2004
Subject: [BioC] human tissue specific genes
