This is due to the fact that there is a zipped file that is being choked 
on. You can get things to work if you simply go to 
C:\path_to_R\library\moe430aprobe\data and unzip the Rdata.zip file you 
will find there.

In the meantime I will make another moe430aprobe file that doesn't have 
the zipped data file. This should be on the BioC website in the next day 
or so.

